### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Create Product (Sample: MacBook Pro)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: ROLE_ADMIN

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-MBP-14",
  "name": "MacBook Pro",
  "description": "Apple M3 Pro 14-inch, 18GB RAM, 512GB SSD Space Black",
  "price": 25000000,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

### 2. Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Products by Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products?category=Electronics
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Product by SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products/sku/LAPTOP-MBP-14
Accept: application/json

### 6. Update Product (Update Price / Description)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: ROLE_ADMIN

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-MBP-14",
  "name": "MacBook Pro 14",
  "description": "Apple M3 Pro 14-inch, 18GB RAM, 512GB SSD - Updated Promo",
  "price": 24500000,
  "category": "Electronics"
}

### 7. Delete Product by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products/1
X-User-Role: ROLE_ADMIN
Accept: application/json

### =======================================================
### Optional: Testing via API Gateway (Requires Gateway & Eureka running)
### =======================================================

### 8. Get All Products via Gateway
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/catalog/products
Accept: application/json
